otogrammetry-scanned models\n\u2022 Scale and rotate the drawing pad \n\u2022 Choose between 3 studio environments\n\u2022 Turn on and off nudity to make it streamer friendly\n\u2022 Support for Left and Right handed artists!\n\u2022 Capture and export your favourite sketches\n(Android\\data\\com.NickLaddVrArtandAnimation.GestureVR\\files\\Images)", "short_description": "Gesture VR is a drawing app with an emphasis on figure drawing.  Draw in 2D or 3D from over 100 high-quality photogrammetry-scanned models and get complete control of the lights, timers, and poses.  Practice alone or group up with friends!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.nickladd.tv/gvr-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Nick Ladd VR Art & Animation", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.nickladd.tv/gesturevr", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ART_CREATIVITY", "CASUAL", "PRODUCTIVITY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "531951988263795"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3257137134450135"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "717079050549412"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "878876323270107"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "717079050549412"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1768845600, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3257137134450135"}]